  "2026-11-08T01:26:42.764Z",codex-agent,"Independent resumed verification: pre-PR-44 reference commit 42170123973a632f51fbcbb128823583c9315c5a has exactly 17 events and 27087 bytes; its SHA-256 matches the new guard. A disposable non-git package copy passes 1/1, then changing only the first event message and resealing it with the pinned SDK produces a valid audit stream with every later event unchanged. Fixed test rejects it 0/1 at the immutable-prefix assertion; removing only the new prefix check makes the same mutation pass 1/1; restoring the check rejects it 0/1; restoring original history passes 1/1. Real history is untouched. Linked pm tests pass 3/3 statement cases and 13/13 provenance/release cases, zero skips. Typecheck, build, build:test, docstring (128 declarations in 19 files), identity/privacy audit (4/4), unchanged committed dist and base-history prefix checks pass. No lint script exists. Strict health retains only the separately tracked extension host version skew as a failure. Starting serial npm and Bun release checks in isolated Git/HOME contexts with a combined 55-minute cap, two test workers and unchanged thresholds."
